{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Version Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo showcases &quot;One More Bang&quot; core mechanics: starting with an identity and a hit list, surviving through strategic use of skills and items. Each round lasts \u200b<strong>\u200b10\u201320 minutes\u200b</strong>\u200b. To experience all currently available identities and items, play at least \u200b<strong>\u200b4 rounds\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upon entering the game, you will be randomly assigned a \u200b<strong>\u200bsystem-generated identity\u200b</strong>\u200b and a \u200b<strong>\u200bhit list\u200b</strong>\u200b. Your sole objective is to eliminate your targets \u200b<strong>\u200bby any means necessary\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can deduce other players\u2019 identities using abilities like \u200b<strong>\u200b\u3010First Night Vision\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b or \u200b<strong>\u3010Behavior Observation\u3011\u200b\u200b or</strong>\u00a0turn the tide with \u200b<strong>\u200b\u3010Identity Skills\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b and \u200b<strong>\u200b\u3010Powerful Items\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware\u2014every player will \u200b<strong>\u200b\u3010Lie\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b, and every action they take may conceal ulterior motives...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Game Rules</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bSingle-Turn Action Logic\u200b</strong>\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bFour Identity Skills\u200b</strong>\u200b (examples below)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bPartial Items &amp; Functions\u200b</strong>\u200b (examples below)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bDemo Limitations\u200b</strong>\u200b:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only the \u200b<strong>\u200bJK Schoolgirl (Saori)\u200b</strong>\u200b role is playable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full roster and items will be unlocked in future updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681150?t=1745896297","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681150?t=1745896297","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681150/0d62b145be3c7de16107cd0dfdc0abd4acc1cbcb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745896297","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681150/0d62b145be3c7de16107cd0dfdc0abd4acc1cbcb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745896297","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Some characters' outfits are somewhat revealing\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Version Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo showcases &quot;One More Bang&quot; core mechanics: starting with an identity and a hit list, surviving through strategic use of skills and items. Each round lasts \u200b<strong>\u200b10\u201320 minutes\u200b</strong>\u200b. To experience all currently available identities and items, play at least \u200b<strong>\u200b4 rounds\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upon entering the game, you will be randomly assigned a \u200b<strong>\u200bsystem-generated identity\u200b</strong>\u200b and a \u200b<strong>\u200bhit list\u200b</strong>\u200b. Your sole objective is to eliminate your targets \u200b<strong>\u200bby any means necessary\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can deduce other players\u2019 identities using abilities like \u200b<strong>\u200b\u3010First Night Vision\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b or \u200b<strong>\u3010Behavior Observation\u3011\u200b\u200b or</strong>\u00a0turn the tide with \u200b<strong>\u200b\u3010Identity Skills\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b and \u200b<strong>\u200b\u3010Powerful Items\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware\u2014every player will \u200b<strong>\u200b\u3010Lie\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b, and every action they take may conceal ulterior motives...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Game Rules</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bSingle-Turn Action Logic\u200b</strong>\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bFour Identity Skills\u200b</strong>\u200b (examples below)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bPartial Items &amp; Functions\u200b</strong>\u200b (examples below)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bDemo Limitations\u200b</strong>\u200b:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only the \u200b<strong>\u200bJK Schoolgirl (Saori)\u200b</strong>\u200b role is playable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full roster and items will be unlocked in future updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Tide Game"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3461580","name":"One More Bang"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681150/992bb25dbf8c1af6be4acaf22d9dc2b36808b7df/header.jpg?t=1745896297","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132014,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132014/movie480.mp4?t=1745829910","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132014/movie_max.mp4?t=1745829910"},"name":"Trialer Rough Cut","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132014/bad180b